  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8cvmxzx72l_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>堡垒之夜游戏玩家统计跟踪数据网站 <a href=\"https://fortnitetracker.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://fortnitetracker.com/</a> 月访问量1290万，游戏相关网站流量太大了。</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://tracker.gg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://tracker.gg/</a> 这家公司旗下，做了很多游戏的这类网站，都是同一套模板。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8cvmxzx72l_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8cvmxzx72l_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>主网站 tracker.gg 月访问量2120万，有些关键词会分出去用新域名做独立网站，有些则直接在主网站下用子目录来做。</div>\n<div>邮件阅读状态跟踪小工具，周活20万 <a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/email-tracker/bnompdfnhdbgdaoanapncknhmckenfog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/email-tracker/bnompdfnhdbgdaoanapncknhmckenfog</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8cvmxzx72l_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>类似产品 mailsuite.com 月访问量380万。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8cvmxzx72l_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个更牛，周活200万。 <a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/gmail-%E7%9A%84-mailtrack-%E5%92%8C%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6/ndnaehgpjlnokgebbaldlmgkapkpjkkb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/gmail-%E7%9A%84-mailtrack-%E5%92%8C%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6/ndnaehgpjlnokgebbaldlmgkapkpjkkb</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/8cvmxzx72l_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
